WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
Sevens: 13 cards each; covered cards are
penalties, lowest total wins. You are West.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:17.000 line:0
Click the ♠7 to start. Then open another suit
with its 7 or extend a row at either end.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:28.000 line:0
Fast-forward: you must play if you can.
Only with no legal play do you cover a card.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:38.999 line:0
West has no play: click ♠A, then confirm the cover.
Penalties: A=1, J=11, Q=12, K=13.

00:00:38.999 --> 00:00:48.999 line:0
North plays the ♣K. Dragon Slaying is on:
an A or K closes both ends of that suit.

00:00:48.999 --> 00:00:59.998 line:0
Fast-forward: every card is played or covered,
then covers are revealed and scored.

00:00:59.998 --> 00:01:09.000 line:0
South has the lowest penalty, 11, and wins;
East, North and West have 12, 17 and 28.
